|----------------------|------------------------------------------------------|
| `int`                | `42`, `-7`                                           |
| `real`               | `3.14`, `-0.5`                                       |
| `bool`               | `true`, `false`                                      |
| `string`             | `"hello"`                                            |
| `Data`               | `new Data { name := "ds" }` — reference to a dataset |
| `IntermediateResult` | returned by package functions; use `commit_result("name", result)` to persist |
| Array                | `[1, 2, 3]`                                          |

