## Functions

```bscript
func <name>(<param>, ...) {
    // body
    return <value>;
}
```

Example:

```bscript
func add(a, b) {
    return a + b;
}

let sum := add(3, 4);
println(sum);
```

Functions with no return value omit the `return` statement:

```bscript
func greet(name) {
    println("Hello, " + name);
}
greet("world");
```

