println("Hello, world!");   // print with newline
print("no newline");        // print without newline
```

---

## If / Else

```bscript
if (condition) {
    // true branch
} else {
    // false branch
}
```

Example:

```bscript
let score := 75;
if (score >= 50) {
    println("Pass");
} else {
    println("Fail");
}
```

---

## While Loop

```bscript
let i := 0;
while (i < 5) {
    println(i);
    i := i + 1;
}
```

---

## For Loop

```bscript
for (let i := 0; i < 10; i := i + 1) {
    println(i);
}
```

---

## Functions

```bscript
func <name>(<param>, ...) {
    // body
    return <value>;
}
```

Example:

```bscript
func add(a, b) {
    return a + b;
}

let sum := add(3, 4);
println(sum);
```

Functions with no return value omit the `return` statement:

```bscript
func greet(name) {
    println("Hello, " + name);
}
greet("world");
```

